flowchart LR
    DEV[git push / PR] --> GH{GitHub Actions}
    GH --> L[Install pnpm deps<br/>cache store]
    L --> LT[Lint + typecheck<br/>+ prisma validate]
    LT --> UT[Unit tests<br/>Jest + coverage]
    LT --> E2E["E2E tests<br/>service containers:<br/>postgres:16, redis:7<br/>prisma migrate deploy → supertest"]
    UT & E2E --> BLD[Docker build<br/>multi-stage]
    BLD --> SEC[npm audit / Trivy scan]
    SEC --> GATE{branch = main?}
    GATE -- no --> DONE([PR status check ✓])
    GATE -- yes --> MIG[prisma migrate deploy<br/>release command]
    MIG --> DAPI[Deploy API service]
    MIG --> DWRK[Deploy Worker service]
    GATE -- yes --> VCL[Vercel auto-deploy web]
    DAPI --> SMK[Smoke test<br/>GET /health/ready]
